ent-BaseMeleeWeaponEnergy = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-EnergySword = 能量劍 | energy sword
    .desc = 一把聲響極大且極其危險的劍，其光束由純淨、高濃度的等離子體構成。能像切黃油般輕易切開未穿戴護甲的目標。 | A very loud & dangerous sword with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. Cuts through unarmored targets like butter.
ent-EnergyDaggerLoud = 能量匕首 | energy dagger
    .desc = 一把光束由純淨、高濃度等離子體構成，但聲響較小且危險性較低的匕首。這把匕首完全沒有偽裝。 | A not as loud and dangerous dagger with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. This one is completely undisguised.
ent-EnergyDagger = 筆 | pen
    .desc = 一支深色墨水筆。 | A dark ink pen.
    .suffix = E-Dagger
ent-EnergyDaggerBox = e-dagger 盒子 | e-dagger box
    .desc = 一個裝有電子匕首的小盒子。包裝在打開時會自行分解，不留任何痕跡。 | A small box containing an e-dagger. Packaging disintegrates when opened, leaving no evidence behind.
    .suffix = E-Dagger
ent-EnergyCutlass = 能量短劍 | energy cutlass
    .desc = 一種異域風格的能量武器。 | An exotic energy weapon.
ent-EnergySwordDouble = 雙刃能量劍 | double-bladed energy sword
    .desc = 「辛迪加指揮部」的實習生們認為，能量劍上只有一把劍刃還不夠。這把劍可以收進口袋裡。 | Syndicate Command Interns thought that having one blade on the energy sword was not enough. This can be stored in pockets.
ent-HyperEutacticBlade = 超共晶葉片 | hypereutactic-blade
    .desc = 這是一種被設想為能將時空結構本身一分為二的超巨大武器，這把超共晶刀能動態地以閃速鍛造出超共晶結晶納米結構，能夠像熱刀切黃油般輕易穿透大多數已知的物質形態。 | A supermassive weapon envisioned to cleave the very fabric of space and time itself in twain, the hypereutactic blade dynamically flash-forges a hypereutactic crystaline nanostructure capable of passing through most known forms of matter like a hot knife through butter.
ent-CyborgEnergySword = { ent-EnergySword }
    .desc = 一把極其轟鳴且危險的劍，其光束由純淨、高濃度的等離子體構成。專為辛迪加賽博格設計。 | A very loud & dangerous sword with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. Specially designed for syndicate cyborgs.
    .suffix = For Borgs
ent-CyborgEnergySwordDouble = { ent-EnergySwordDouble }
    .desc = 「辛迪加指揮部」的實習生們認為，能量劍上僅有一把刀刃還不夠。此款專為辛迪加賽博格設計。 | Syndicate Command Interns thought that having one blade on the energy sword was not enough. Specially designed for syndicate cyborgs.
    .suffix = One-Handed, For Borgs
ent-EnergyDaggerLoudBlue = { ent-EnergyDaggerLoud }
    .desc = { ent-EnergyDaggerLoud.desc }
    .suffix = blue
